{"ts": 1793395193030, "run_id": "real-b", "agent_id": "agentB", "type": "memory.retrieved", "data": {"entries": [{"entry_id": "0xce493d58f47e7b8e213c9c7cc9a44e3b9edca26db58ed30b99a8618099500724", "cid": "bafkreicd2xnurllzlelafxcykbl4k5o3v2d5ztxprem4i6miqrsi7hka2y", "kind": "regression", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "lru-cache: Removed the `self.capacity > 0` check in the `on_evict` callback invocation.; Ensured `on_evict` is called whenever an item is evicted, regardless of cache capacity.", "created_at": 1793394284}, {"entry_id": "0x2d78cf7ac97d0ebcc4b5a4b6703061b8b0c340b771f6d1eeb094a4fdcef8804b", "cid": "bafkreicknssvxkvrtsm42bo2rjnsdhm7c4nmvhwblozywku3aku4hpohcy", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Validated", "confidence": 1.0, "summary": "lru-cache: Removed `on_evict` callback invocation during key update in `put` method.; Updated key update block to only remove the key from cache without calling `on_evict`.", "created_at": 1793384939}, {"entry_id": "0x938968e86bf23d784ff5f453905cb42b3ae02ad0a8b2247bb6367b481d5d2959", "cid": "bafkreihzirf6fbn72fmfhcyyomsu46wmzfwvb4zcvt5tohkqbylz2sl4nm", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Validated", "confidence": 1.0, "summary": "lru-cache: Added validation for negative capacity in `__init__` method.; Added handling for zero capacity in `put` method to make it a no-op.; Modified `put` method to call `on_evict` when replacing an existing key.", "created_at": 1793384721}, {"entry_id": "0x3056e586c17c2722695203a936af96f25d59ed74b766679f439dbc4a55ee6001", "cid": "bafkreia4dubuxuyegm27uiktpxmmzsofx6kxavlgnm4k4gh5wmnljrg4ji", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "lru-cache: Added capacity validation in `__init__` to raise `ValueError` for negative capacities.; Modified the `put` method to call `on_evict` only if `capacity` is greater than zero.", "created_at": 1793394065}, {"entry_id": "0x698d269e524259c9c8c3f947262def8bb0972b80374c6af86223445ee633c990", "cid": "bafkreidcuv3rkxy6stiqxy4ucbo5o75ipd66horsokgcxq7gkrxnrky2sa", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "ttl-cache: Introduced `heapq` for efficient expiration management.; Replaced linear scan with a min-heap in `_remove_expired` method.; Added `expiry_heap` attribute to store expiration times as tuples `(expiry, key)`.", "created_at": 1793388288}, {"entry_id": "0x0c5c8fb6c6ac03653d5260a600c23574b5a22add1c93a43ef643cbd42eaeb7ce", "cid": "bafkreiggxhih7jyexu7he4hvgphtji7di6mkqvwkudlox23tphznvycbiy", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "ttl-cache: Added input validation for non-negative capacity and positive TTL in `__init__`.; Added `_remove_expired` method to handle expired items cleanup.; Added early return in `put()` if capacity is zero or less.", "created_at": 1793388066}, {"entry_id": "0x6338a71a4238682cea244d1963e54380aca5c836502c65da94bda8ea5374e9cd", "cid": "bafkreibonjspyi4vcio66ss3msajuwmrdscfq6ngoke6ymydeb7mi6pxnu", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "ttl-cache: Added `live_count` attribute to track the number of live items.; Implemented `_cleanup_expired` method to handle expired items cleanup.; Updated `put` method to call `_cleanup_expired` instead of directly removing expired items.", "created_at": 1793387615}, {"entry_id": "0x4665dc3bc761b1f4bc2629efa762f8a470491f9c1b3946276eb1ba845ef3a822", "cid": "bafkreigg7id6l3cyenz4pggzpssjhssmimz5aayhwvclkwdt7ehvxzs37u", "kind": "improvement", "tier": "Candidate", "confidence": 0.5, "summary": "ttl-cache: Added validation for non-positive TTL values in the constructor.; Implemented removal of expired items before evicting live items in `put()`.; Used `OrderedDict.move_to_end()` for rewrites to maintain proper ordering.", "created_at": 1793387373}], "token_budget": 800}}
